  ["Government fees", "Official fees vary based on the authority and the service requested."],
  ["Business structure", "Mainland companies, free zone businesses, and branch offices may have different procedures."],
  ["Number of applications", "Businesses handling multiple visas or government transactions may have different service requirements."],
